Subject: [PATCH] Gate Odoo comment replay on the server capability

Odoo advertises comment replay on issue detail after the receipt table is
available. Use keyed uploads and check the receipt before sending files.
Keep legacy comments and guard unsupported skill revision writes.

Issue: TASK-1-1-8
